      "rationale": "Scope (single_user vs building_wide) is a strong candidate driver of duration. However 'Printing issues in office' -> 'floor_specific' and VPN -> 'infrastructure_component' are confident specifics the text does not clearly warrant, indicating partial invention."
    },
    {
      "name": "severity_signal",
      "analytical_usefulness": 0.45,
      "source_groundedness": 0.55,
      "hallucination_observed": false,
      "rationale": "A bare boolean severity flag adds limited leverage and partly overlaps with the existing priority column. Values are plausible but the text basis is thin; no clear contradiction observed in samples."
    },
    {
      "name": "issue_complexity_signal",
      "analytical_usefulness": 0.8,
      "source_groundedness": 0.5,
      "hallucination_observed": true,
      "rationale": "Complexity is directly relevant to resolution duration and offers a good modeling axis. But low/medium/high assignments (e.g. VPN->medium, database->low) are confident gradations not clearly derivable from the short descriptions, so groundedness is moderate."
    }
  ],
